{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":39.970001220703125,"text":"An old man with a long beard sits in a marble chair at the top of the main staircase, hands resting calmly on his knees. He is Charles Darwin, and the statue was unveiled in 1885, three years after his death. As a young man, Darwin spent five years on a ship sailing around the world, collecting birds, beetles, and fossils, and he noticed that on each island, the finches had slightly different beaks. From small observations like that, he worked out that animals change little by little from one generation to the next. The statue was moved twice and came back to its place in 2009, for the 200th anniversary of his birth.","words":[{"word":"An","start":0,"end":0.3799999952316284},{"word":"old","start":0.3799999952316284,"end":0.7200000286102295},{"word":"man","start":0.7200000286102295,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"with","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.1200000047683716},{"word":"a","start":1.1200000047683716,"end":1.340000033378601},{"word":"long","start":1.340000033378601,"end":1.6200000047683716},{"word":"beard","start":1.6200000047683716,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"sits","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.359999895095825},{"word":"in","start":2.359999895095825,"end":2.5199999809265137},{"word":"a","start":2.5199999809265137,"end":2.799999952316284},{"word":"marble","start":2.799999952316284,"end":2.9600000381469727},{"word":"chair","start":2.9600000381469727,"end":3.319999933242798},{"word":"at","start":3.319999933242798,"end":3.5799999237060547},{"word":"the","start":3.5799999237060547,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"top","start":3.680000066757202,"end":3.859999895095825},{"word":"of","start":3.859999895095825,"end":4.019999980926514},{"word":"the","start":4.019999980926514,"end":4.139999866485596},{"word":"main","start":4.139999866485596,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"staircase","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.940000057220459},{"word":"hands","start":5.7399997711181